    "detailed_description": "Bad Pixels is an 8-bit 3D shoot-out set in the old west, currently in development.<br><br>Have you ever wondered what a FPS game would look like in 8-bit? It's gotta look bad, right? <br><br>Introducing BAD PIXELS. A first person shooter set in the old west, using computer graphics from about the same era!<br><br>As the new sheriff in town, explore this open world, completing various missions to solve the mystery of Bad Pixels.<br><br>Core Gameplay:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>16 main missions and many side missions.<br></li><li>5 Boss fights.<br></li><li>Mission Editor to share custom missions.</li></ul><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rocking 8-bit chip-tune sound track.<br></li><li>Badly pixelated graphics.<br></li><li>First person shooting.</li></ul><br>So grease up your 6 iron, don your stetson and shake them snakes outta your boots, we're going on a wild ride!",
